{"id":"vod_md_2180","vodId":"2180","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"传说中勇者的传说","name_cn":"传说中勇者的传说","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230809-1/f82857abca31d9a35f6275907e0a222e.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个充斥着传说的世界中。在大陆南方的位置上有一个国家名叫罗兰帝国，由于这个国家当权贵族的腐败导致百姓生活在水深火热之中。在这种情况下临危接受国王西昂命令的青年拉因那与少女菲莉斯，三个人的旅途就这么开始了。不过，男主角拉因那是一个超没有干劲的人，他最大的爱好居然是白天睡大觉，梦想能够建立一个白天睡觉的国家。在这种情况下他们被卷入了战争的漩涡，三位年轻人的纠葛负责的命运将会如何发展呢？拉因那的『瞳孔』中所映出的世界又是怎么样的未来？【STAFF】监督：川崎逸朗（《战国BASARA》《钢壳都市雷吉欧斯》）系列构成：村清子（《武装机甲》）角色设定：岛泽ノリコ（「D.C.II」《乙女爱上姐姐》）动画制作：ZEXCS（《钢壳都市雷吉欧斯》《海物语》等）","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-09 08:30:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/sOYpNFEV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/o36K4lHc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/BBcvrr05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/AyLDE64i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/AF3s5kJT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/nOqufXes/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/r45eGaJi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/2VGKexcQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/QilSHFoQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/qo9uHhDg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/3mgBZXQt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/kxStHxKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/DKiIf7tE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/uT5lHHIJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modu